Z||000002||Gokart||02-12-2000||05:38 AM||||Hey Cobra, theres one at e-bay now and the bid's at $45.00. I want one but do you think thats kind of steep and is there plenty more out there I could get a better deal on? It sure would come in handy for knowing what parts I could use from my SE parts car for my GT.<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 02-12-2000).]||||reg||2
Z||000003||RossT||02-12-2000||05:47 AM||||Gokart, The guy on e-bay is selling 3 of them on a dutch auction.  I bought one from him about 2 months ago.  They are NOS in shrink wrap, never used. I have never seen them cheaper (although they originally sold for $10 several years ago).  Infact I have found a few people that have NOS ones and they all want more.  One guy in Michigan is asking $90.00 for his, and he has several of them.  Way to much!! I think that if you are going to need one in the future, you should buy now.  They are not going to go down in price.  It is unlikely that someone will reprint it either.  Anyway, I had now problems with this guy on e-bay.<P>Ross<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 02-12-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||sluppy123||02-12-2000||02:37 PM||||Thanks for the help Cobra. I really need to get one of those books.<P>Thanks again-Brain<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000005||cobra427||02-12-2000||05:22 PM||||Hi neighbor,<BR> $45.00 is not a bad price if it stays there but I doubt that it will. What I did was wait till I went to some of the shows in the spring and summer. There always seems to be somebody wanting to sell one or a service manual. I paid $25.00 for one,that in the coin industry, would be cosidered ms-60 or used but in excellant condition and the same for my service manual ($10.00)  In the meantime, I don't think that any of us would mind shareing a few numbers for the good of the association.:-) If you can't wait, put your bid in and hope it holds. Personally, I wouldn't go any higher than $50.00 and that I would have to think about a little.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Gokart||02-13-2000||05:47 AM||||Thanks Cobra! Maybe I'll find one if we hit a show or two this summer. Nice to know you have one though just in case I need some cross refrencing.||||reg||12
